/components/ComposeForm.tsx:139:3\n  137 |   // on each keystroke (which would prevent it from ever firing while typing).\n  138 |   const latestDraftRef = useRef({ to, cc, bcc, subject, body, replyTo });\n> 139 |   latestDraftRef.current = { to, cc, bcc, subject, body, replyTo };\n      |   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ Cannot update ref during render\n  140 |\n  141 |   const saveDraftMutate = saveDraftMutation.mutate;\n  142 |   // biome-ignore lint/correctness/useExhaustiveDependencies: to/cc/bcc/subject/body are intentionally listed so each keystroke restarts the 8s debounce timer; the actual values are read from latestDraftRef at fire time.","React Hook useEffect has a missing dependency: 'editReminder'. Either include it or remove the dependency array.",["580"],["581"],"@typescript-eslint/no-require-imports","A `require()` style import is forbidden.","CallExpression","noRequireImports","React Hook useCallback has a missing dependency: 'parseAddresses'. Either include it or remove the dependency array.",["582"],"'FavouriteIcon' is defined but never used.",["583"],"'width' is assigned a value but never used.","'api' is assigned a value but never used.","react-hooks/preserve-manual-memoization","Compilation Skipped: Existing memoization could not be preserved\n\nReact Compiler has skipped optimizing this component because the existing manual memoization could not be preserved. The inferred dependencies did not match the manually specified dependencies, which could cause the value to change more or less frequently than expected. The inferred dependency was `t`, but the source dependencies were [oxyServices]. Inferred different dependency than source.\n\n/home/nate/Oxy/.extract/oxy-baseline/packages/inbox/components/MessageDetail.tsx:277:40\n  275 |   const resolvedHtmlMap = useCidResolver(sortedThread, oxyServices, messageId);\n  276 |\n> 277 |   const handleAttachment = useCallback(async (fileId: string, filename: string) => {\n      |                                  